# D-RECYCLE-RESET-UNDER-NOINO-STRANDS-COMMITTED-DIR-CHANGE-WEDGE-SHUTDOWN, the
# TCP half of the build that carries both halves of the fix: srcversion
# C06A6D4A9AB7A357503DF51 (noino_recycle_dirty_wait, noino_recycle_takeover,
# the live-check skip's re-drive of a taken release, and the TEST ONLY
# dbg_recycle_nowait).  2/net/mesh/mpath g2, the configuration of
# ndrc3/ndrf3; every harness refuses a node not running the tree build.
#
# Laps 1-2, H-W2 (tests/noino_dirty_recycle_ab.sh header, NDR_ARM=takeover):
# the lookup reproducer with its recycle sent on as a caller that cannot wait,
# noino_recycle_takeover 0 then 1.  Laps 3-4, H-W1 again on this build: the
# same reproducer with the recycle allowed to wait, noino_recycle_dirty_wait
# 0 then 1 (the lookup fix measured on the build that ships).
#
# VERDICT RULES (written before the first lap):
#   FIXED      lap 2 PASS (every iteration ran, no listing held the renamed
#              name, recycle_dirty_takeover > 0, no reset of a dirty corpse,
#              cold audit CLEAN, no node failure in either whole kernel log)
#              and lap 4 PASS, with each control showing it reached the case
#              (lap 1 recycle_reset_dirty > 0, lap 3 hazard + reset_dirty > 0).
#              A control that reached the case and still read CONTROL-FRESH
#              is recorded as such: the fix arm's PASS then says the fix does
#              no harm, not that it closed anything, and the hypothesis is
#              re-examined.
#   NOT FIXED  any fix-arm FAIL: diagnose from its kept logs before anything
#              else.
#   NO VERDICT an ABORT, or a VACUOUS fix arm: rerun that lap.
#
# Bound per lap, from the harness header's derivation: prep 300 + srcversion
# and knob reads 2x20 + 2x20 + mkdir 30 + ten iterations x (10 + 10 +
# (PREFENCE 2.5 + 10) x 2) = 450 + counters 2x40 + knob resets 2x20 + chk_clean
# 150 + stream copy 2x120 = 1370 s.
1370 NDR_ARM=takeover tests/noino_dirty_recycle_ab.sh ntc1 0 10 2/net/mesh/mpath g2
1370 NDR_ARM=takeover tests/noino_dirty_recycle_ab.sh ntf1 1 10 2/net/mesh/mpath g2
1370 tests/noino_dirty_recycle_ab.sh ndrc4 0 10 2/net/mesh/mpath g2
1370 tests/noino_dirty_recycle_ab.sh ndrf4 1 10 2/net/mesh/mpath g2
